        "07ba920bf4587238f1ae": "Renzik was looking for you, fish.$B$BI wouldn't keep Mathias's second in command waiting if I were you.\n",
        "82d494c19729a6c8e79b": "Are you ready to get to work or do you need to take a nap before we get started?"
      },
